/*
  Shared Search outcome vocabulary.

  Keep all six outcomes here even when an individual case uses only a subset.
  That lets new records — including future or still-active searches — use the
  same component and visual language without extending the system later.

  partial: something relevant was found, but the main objective remains unresolved
  noDiscovery: the principal target was not found
  abandoned: the attempt ended before its objective could be resolved
  disputed: a claimed result remains contested
  successful: the stated search objective was verified or recovered
  ongoing: the search is active and has not yet reached a final outcome
*/
